description: Summarize staged changes and propose a conventional-commit message.
allowed-tools: Bash(git *)
---

## Context
- !\`git status --short\`

## Context
- !\`git diff --cached\`

From the staged changes above, propose ONE conventional-commit message (type(scope): subject) plus a short body. Do not run git commit.
